[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14521.189, "timestamp": "04:02:01", "text": "“是啊，你为什么要这么做？你为什么要这么做？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14523.75, "timestamp": "04:02:03", "text": "关机后电脑会重命名吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14525.75, "timestamp": "04:02:05", "text": "说真的，比如说如果你在工作呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14527.429, "timestamp": "04:02:07", "text": "在某件事上，感觉就像是，“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14529.99, "timestamp": "04:02:09", "text": "没关系。就这样吧。”我做了个鬼脸。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14533.11, "timestamp": "04:02:13", "text": "确认同意系统。点赞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14536.07, "timestamp": "04:02:16", "text": "比如如果有人兑换了它，如果像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14538.229, "timestamp": "04:02:18", "text": "类似这样的消息：是的，你必须保存"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14541.03, "timestamp": "04:02:21", "text": "请填写您的内容，然后只需按“是”或“否”即可。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14543.349, "timestamp": "04:02:23", "text": "如果答案是肯定的，它将关闭。它将"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14544.95, "timestamp": "04:02:24", "text": "几分钟后启动关机程序。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14547.59, "timestamp": "04:02:27", "text": "分钟。不，如果它会抵消"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14551.189, "timestamp": "04:02:31", "text": "赎回物品并退款给对方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14555.51, "timestamp": "04:02:35", "text": "正确的。正确的。我的天啊。就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14558.389, "timestamp": "04:02:38", "text": "极端。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14560.07, "timestamp": "04:02:40", "text": "就像我见过的那些，就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14562.229, "timestamp": "04:02:42", "text": "就像关闭水流一样。那就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14564.229, "timestamp": "04:02:44", "text": "哦，对，比如如果你有一百万的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14566.87, "timestamp": "04:02:46", "text": "您可以关闭流量的点。但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14569.03, "timestamp": "04:02:49", "text": "就像你付出了额外的努力一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14571.03, "timestamp": "04:02:51", "text": "我当时就想，行啊，干脆把我的整个系统都拆了吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14573.189, "timestamp": "04:02:53", "text": "系统。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14575.83, "timestamp": "04:02:55", "text": "我好像在推特上看到过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14577.99, "timestamp": "04:02:57", "text": "正在进行电脑关机操作。我当时就像"}]